h 2 layers unfrozen, unfreeze 2 additional layers every 2 epochs until 8 layers unfrozen. Adapt OneCycleLR to handle multiple parameter groups by setting max_lr for each group according to LLRD. Apply mixup with 15% probability per batch. Keep early stopping patience=5, label smoothing 0.1, gradient clipping 1.0, mixed precision, and inference unchanged."}, "parse_success": true, "raw_response": "{
