 loss (BCE with lambda=0.3) from the gating MLP's manual feature branch to enforce structural learning, a simplification of the auxiliary task from failed experiments to avoid instability. Keep early stopping patience=5, label smoothing=0.1, gradient clipping=1.0, mixed precision, and inference unchanged."}, "parse_success": true, "raw_response": "{
